$ go mod init example
$ go test -bench=. -benchmem -benchtime=2000x -run='^$' >bench.txt
$ awk '/allocs\/op$/ { sub(/-[0-9]+$/, "", $1); printf "%-30s %5s B/op %3s allocs/op\n", $1, $(NF-3), $(NF-1) }' bench.txt
BenchmarkJoinWithPlus            880 B/op   8 allocs/op
BenchmarkJoinWithBuilder         256 B/op   1 allocs/op
BenchmarkJoinWithPlusOldLoop     880 B/op   8 allocs/op
$ grep -E '^(PASS|FAIL|ok|Benchmark.* entered)' bench.txt
PASS
BenchmarkJoinWithPlus entered 1 time(s)
BenchmarkJoinWithBuilder entered 1 time(s)
BenchmarkJoinWithPlusOldLoop entered 2 time(s)
ok  	example
exit status 0
